==Battleground==
*5 [[Croconator]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*2 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Lutrinae Gokurakko]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Angelic Beast Rajakong]]s spawn, delay 66.67~70 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,100f</sup>.
**2 [[Lutrinae Gokurakko]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 73.33~76.67 seconds<sup>2,200f~2,300f</sup>.
**1 [[Casaurian Ahirujo]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**50 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
**10 [[Croconator]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**10 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**4 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn, delay 40~50 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,500f</sup>.
**60 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Despite having two Rajakongs and Gokurakkos, it can be beaten easily with right units. If you spam [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] with an (M) Research [[Cat Combo]], such as [[Biohazard (Combo)|Biohazard]] and [[Bony Bone (Combo)|Bony Bone]], [[Ancient Egg: N106 (Rare Cat)|Mushroom Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] ([[Food Stall Cat (Rare Cat)|Cafeteria Cat]] can help as well, if you have them), the stage falls apart relatively easily. After triggering the boss wave, take out first Rajakong and Gokurakko, then destroy the base before the second ones spawn. Casaurian Ahirujo will not be much of an issue thanks to Courier Cat.

